    "rules": [
      "Use facility identity, ownership, address, contact, PM-JAY scheme and supplied speciality labels from this dataset.",
      "Do not claim a specific test or procedure is available unless an explicit verified source capability mapping exists.",
      "Do not translate speciality abbreviations into diagnostic tests without an authoritative code mapping.",
      "IPHS level is inferred only from explicit facility naming such as PHC, CHC, SDH or UHC; UNKNOWN means no safe classification from the supplied listing.",
      "Missing location coordinates remain null; never invent distance or travel time.",
      "For service-specific questions, combine this directory with the separate VDA pilot capability mapping.",
      "This dataset is not a real-time availability feed."
    ]
  },
